Z||000002||btoth||09-24-2001||09:59 AM|||| <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/emumen/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/emumen/</A> <P>At least has the good games like Zelda... (which I think was the only good game for N64).  The best emulator is UltraHLE.<P>As far as the playstation goes... the best way is to go rent a good game for $4 and copy the cd or save the .iso file to your hard drive.  <A HREF="http://www.psxemu.com/emulators.shtml" TARGET=_blank>http://www.psxemu.com/emulators.shtml</A>   The emulator I use is ePSXe... seems to work fine, I only have one game so far.||||reg||1
